  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "இல்லாமை கந்தா இரவு துணிந்தொருவர்\nசெல்லாரும் அல்லர் சிறுநெறி - புல்லா\nஅகம்புகுமின் உண்ணுமின் என்பவர்மாட் டல்லான்\nமுகம்புகுதல் ஆற்றுமோ மேல்?",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Ask only of the courteous. There will never be wanting those who, with their destitution as their support (making it their excuse), will venture upon mendicancy, and tread the way of humiliation; but will the noble-minded man enter (as a suppliant) the presence of any save of those who will embrace him and say, 'Enter my dwelling, eat of my food ?'",
